1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Resilient Lead Intake for GoHighLevel
Official Sandbox verification — no production data

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:28,000
The contact was created through the integration.
HighLevel shows the proof tag, source, and linked opportunity.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Each verifier run sends the same contact twice.
Both upserts return one stable contact ID and one open opportunity.

4
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:03,000
The verifier confirms the pipeline and stage belong to this Sandbox
before it allows any write.

5
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Only reserved example.com contacts are used.
No phone number, customer data, message, appointment, or payment is involved.

6
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Evidence: authentication, idempotent contact upsert,
opportunity reuse, 228 tests, and a public sanitized JSON result.

